{
  "_comment": [
    "LIBRARY TEMPLATE — CIP-0056 SETTLEMENT (DvP), against any registry that",
    "implements AllocationFactory.",
    "",
    "  AllocationFactory_Allocate  (splice-api-token-allocation-instruction-v1)",
    "",
    "This is the flow institutional settlement uses: a sender allocates an asset",
    "to a settlement identified by a reference, naming an executor and deadlines.",
    "A conforming registry locks the asset until settleBefore and returns change,",
    "so it does strictly more work per operation than a plain transfer — which",
    "makes the transfer/allocation comparison worth running.",
    "",
    "Parameters are the same as token-standard-transfer.json plus an executor",
    "role, so the two can be run back to back against one registry.",
    "",
    "  node src/cli.ts check workloads/token-standard-allocation.json"
  ],

  "version": 1,
  "parties": "$param:parties",
  "roles": ["admin", "executor"],

  "setup": [
    {
      "id": "factory",
      "disclose": true,
      "actAs": ["$role:admin"],
      "op": {
        "kind": "create",
        "template": "$param:factoryTemplate",
        "args": "$param:factoryArgs"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "holdings",
      "count": "$param:holdings",
      "actAs": "$param:holdingActAs",
      "op": {
        "kind": "create",
        "template": "$param:holdingTemplate",
        "args": "$param:holdingArgs"
      }
    }
  ],

  "operations": [
    {
      "weight": 1,
      "op": {
        "kind": "exercise",
        "template": "#splice-api-token-allocation-instruction-v1:Splice.Api.Token.AllocationInstructionV1:AllocationFactory",
        "contract": "$ref:factory",
        "choice": "AllocationFactory_Allocate",
        "args": {
          "expectedAdmin": "$role:admin",
          "allocation": {
            "settlement": {
              "executor": "$role:executor",
              "settlementRef": { "id": "$param:settlementRef", "cid": null },
              "requestedAt": "$now-60s",
              "allocateBefore": "$now+1h",
              "settleBefore": "$now+2h",
              "meta": { "values": {} }
            },
            "transferLegId": "leg-1",
            "transferLeg": {
              "sender": "$p0",
              "receiver": "$p1",
              "amount": "$param:transferAmount",
              "instrumentId": { "admin": "$role:admin", "id": "$param:instrumentId" },
              "meta": { "values": {} }
            }
          },
          "requestedAt": "$now-60s",
          "inputHoldingCids": ["$ref:holdings[*]"],
          "extraArgs": { "context": { "values": {} }, "meta": { "values": {} } }
        }
      },
      "submit": { "actAs": ["$p0"] }
    }
  ]
}
